*SPEF "IEEE 1481-1998"
*DESIGN "inverter"
*DATE "2026"
*VENDOR "GAA3 reference extractor (gaa3_pex.py)"
*PROGRAM "gaa3_pex"
*VERSION "1.0"
*DESIGN_FLOW "PIN_CAP NONE" "NAME_SCOPE LOCAL"
*DIVIDER /
*DELIMITER :
*BUS_DELIMITER [ ]
*T_UNIT 1 PS
*C_UNIT 1 FF
*R_UNIT 1 OHM
*L_UNIT 1 HENRY

*NAME_MAP
*1 a
*2 y
*3 float0
*4 float1
*5 float2
*6 float3
*7 VSS
*8 VDD

